    {
      "fileName": "goblin-song.json",
      "id": "QZb0Utg0WFPf2Qg0",
      "name": "Goblin Song",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "QZb0Utg0WFPf2Qg0",
        "folder": "QNG8azRxjOSDbz8x",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Goblin Song",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You sing annoying goblin songs, distracting your foes with silly and repetitive lyrics. Attempt a @Check[performance|defense:will] check against the Will DC of a single enemy within 30 feet. This has all the usual traits and restrictions of a Performance check to sing.</p>\n<p>You can affect up to two targets within range if you have expert proficiency in Performance, four if you have master proficiency, and eight if you have legendary proficiency.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes a –1 status penalty to Perception checks and Will saves for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Goblin Song (Critical Success)]</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a –1 status penalty to Perception checks and Will saves for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Goblin Song (Success)]</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is temporarily immune to Goblin Song for 1 hour.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "goblin"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 1,
      "category": "ancestry"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "goblin-weapon-familiarity.json",
      "id": "OYjzfTeWU7RJBT7v",
      "name": "Goblin Weapon Familiarity",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "OYjzfTeWU7RJBT7v",
        "folder": "QNG8azRxjOSDbz8x",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Goblin Weapon Familiarity",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Others might look upon them with disdain, but you know that the weapons of your people are as effective as they are sharp. You gain access to all uncommon weapons with the goblin trait. You have familiarity with weapons with the goblin trait—for the purposes of proficiency, you treat any of these that are martial weapons as simple weapons and any that are advanced weapons as martial weapons.</p>\n<p>At 5th level, whenever you get a critical hit with one of these weapons, you get its critical specialization effect.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "definition": [
                "item:trait:goblin",
                "item:category:martial"
              ],
              "key": "MartialProficiency",
              "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.MartialProficiency.MartialGoblinWeapons",
              "sameAs": "simple",
              "slug": "martial-goblin-weapons"
            },
            {
              "definition": [
                "item:trait:goblin",
                "item:category:advanced"
              ],
              "key": "MartialProficiency",
              "label": "PF2E.SpecificRule.MartialProficiency.AdvancedGoblinWeapons",
              "sameAs": "martial",
              "slug": "advanced-goblin-weapons"
            },
            {
              "key": "CriticalSpecialization",
              "predicate": [
                {
                  "gte": [
                    "self:level",
                    5
                  ]
                },
                "item:trait:goblin"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
